{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>夜晚約9時半，仍有不少旅客經新皇崗口岸返港。現場所見，近乎全部自助通道都有開放，每條通道有三至四人排隊，過關流程大致暢順。</p><p></p><p>保安局「口岸通」晚上10時顯示，平均過關輪候時間正常，約是5分鐘。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T15:41:25.651987+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":95,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T14:59:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T16:18:14.561439+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T15:38:06.798401+00:00","content_hash":"6510a306738332faacd9ce6f2f12be5b47e22c4acd9c7c736a06e1929150e2af","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}